Every vehicle must have an ownership classification.

Create these categories:

### A. Company Owned

Vehicles legally owned by the operating fleet organization.

The organization controls their normal fleet operations, subject to existing organizational permissions.

These vehicles can be associated with:

- Vehicle finance.
- Insurance.
- Registration.
- Maintenance.
