- Owner name.
- Mobile number.
- Email.
- Address.
- Identity documents.
- Bank/payment details with restricted access.
- Vehicle ownership proof.
- Agreement details.
- Financial arrangements.
- Maintenance responsibility.
- Contract duration.

Do not assume that the vehicle owner and driver are the same individual.

One individual owner may supply multiple vehicles and employ different drivers for each vehicle.

